{"records":[{"timestamp_text":"2026-03-01 10:00 UTC","participants":["RedFox","Carol V."],"summary":"The first report states that the RedFox handle belongs to Carol V. and that RedFox sent the message at 2026-03-01 10:00 UTC. This is presented as the reporting party's account; no platform ownership record is included.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-report-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/report/paragraph-3"}]},{"timestamp_text":"approximately 2026-03-01 11:00 UTC","participants":["RedFox","Carla V."],"summary":"A witness instead says RedFox may refer to Carla V. and recalls the message at approximately 2026-03-01 11:00 UTC. The witness identifies the time as uncertain and does not claim to have seen a verified account-owner record, leaving the RedFox identity claim and chronology unresolved relative to the first report.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-witness-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/witness/paragraph-1"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["RedFox","Carol V.","Carla V."],"summary":"A platform export confirms that a handle named RedFox appeared in the relevant message thread, but the account identifier and ownership fields are redacted. It therefore supports handle presence but does not establish whether Carol V. or Carla V. controlled the handle; account ownership would require verification from unredacted platform records or another reliable ownership source.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-platform-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/platform/handle-export/redfox"}]},{"timestamp_text":"2026-03-01 11:02 UTC","participants":["RedFox","M-77"],"summary":"Message metadata identifies message M-77 and records a collection-side timestamp of 2026-03-01 11:02 UTC, but does not provide a reliable sent-at timestamp. The collection time must not be substituted for incident time, so this record does not resolve the conflicting approximately 10:00 versus 11:00 UTC chronology.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-message-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/message